    "body": "Looking at similar paragraphs in that section, the plural (in both `attributes` and `elements'`) seems to be deliberate.\r\n\r\nPersonally, I prefer to avoid that kind of pluralization, e.g.:\r\n- \"The `foo` IDL attribute of every X, Y, and Z element must reflect the element's `foo` content attribute.\r\n\r\nor\r\n- \"For each X, Y, and Z element, the `foo` IDL attribute must reflect the element's `foo` content attribute.\"",
